<section id="card" class="docs-section">
  <h1 class="section-title">Card</h1>
  <div class="section-body">
    <p>IVORY cards are built with as little markup and styles as possible, but provides a lot of customization. IVORY
      cards can be used
      in many ways, the below examples will give you some idea.</p>

    <div class="row mb-2">
      <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-4">
        <div class="iv-card">
          <div class="iv-card-header">
            <h4 class="text-600 mb-0">Card Title</h4>
          </div>
          <div class="iv-card-content">
            <p class="text-16 text-300 mb-0">Some quick example text to build on the card title and make up the bulk of
              the card's content.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="row mb-2">
      <div class="col-12">
        <pre>
                  <code>
                    &lt;div class="iv-card"&gt;<br/>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;div class="iv-card-header"&gt;<br/>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;h4 class="text-600 mb-0"&gt;Card Title&lt;/h4&gt;<br/>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;<br/>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;div class="iv-card-content"&gt;<br/>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;p class="text-16 text-300 mb-0"&gt;<br/>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Some quick example text to build on the card title and make up the bulk of the card's content.<br/>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<br/>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;<br/>
                    &lt;/div&gt;
                  </code>
                </pre>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>